sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Gateway API HTTPRoute<br/>or OpenShift Route
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>:8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KubeAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>:6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Rest as rest-container<br/>:8080/TCP HTTP
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>:5432/TCP
    participant Operator as model-registry-operator<br/>controller-manager

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,DB: Data Plane - Model Registry API Request
        Client->>Ingress: HTTPS Request<br/>/model-registry/{name}/...
        Ingress->>Proxy: Forward request<br/>TLS terminated / path rewrite
        Proxy->>KubeAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>Check: get services in namespace
        KubeAPI-->>Proxy: Allowed / Denied
        alt Authorized
            Proxy->>Rest: HTTP to 127.0.0.1:{rest-port}<br/>loopback proxy
            Rest->>DB: SQL Query<br/>PostgreSQL protocol
            DB-->>Rest: Query Result
            Rest-->>Proxy: HTTP Response
            Proxy-->>Ingress: HTTPS Response
            Ingress-->>Client: Response
        else Denied
            Proxy-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Operator,KubeAPI: Control Plane - Operator Reconciliation
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Watch ModelRegistry CRs<br/>HTTPS/WSS, SA token
        KubeAPI-->>Operator: CR Event (Create/Update/Delete)
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Create/Update Deployment<br/>rest-container + kube-rbac-proxy
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Create/Update Service<br/>:8080 HTTP, :8443 HTTPS
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Create/Update RBAC<br/>Roles, RoleBindings, ClusterRoleBindings
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicy
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Create/Update Secrets<br/>TLS certs, DB credentials
        alt Gateway API available
            Operator->>KubeAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>→ data-science-gateway
        else OpenShift cluster
            Operator->>KubeAPI: Create Route<br/>TLS terminated HTTPS
        end
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Update CR Status
    end

    rect rgb(248, 240, 255)
        Note over Client,KubeAPI: Admission - Webhook Processing
        Client->>KubeAPI: Create/Update ModelRegistry CR
        KubeAPI->>Operator: POST /validate-...<br/>Validating Webhook (fail policy)
        Operator-->>KubeAPI: Admit / Reject
        KubeAPI->>Operator: POST /mutate-...<br/>Mutating Webhook (fail policy)
        Operator-->>KubeAPI: Mutated CR / Reject
        KubeAPI-->>Client: CR Created/Updated
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Operator,KubeAPI: Migration - CRD Version Upgrade
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Create StorageVersionMigration<br/>v1alpha1 → v1beta1
        KubeAPI->>Operator: POST /convert<br/>Conversion Webhook
        Operator-->>KubeAPI: Converted resource
    end
